From: Don Gunn <don.gunn@futureelectronics.com>
Subject: [PATCH] imx8mp_evk: fdc-mamabear board support

Board code, 2GB DDR4 timing and memory map, and dtb build entry for the
Future FDC i.MX8MP Mamabear board.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board specific]
---
